Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying, you want me\Nto kill that thing right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.29,0:01:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This adorable living creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.17,0:01:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we want to survive,\Nthere's no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.69,0:01:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why then you do it, preferably\Nsomewhere I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.35,0:01:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's also an experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
