Dialogue: 2,0:01:53.09,0:01:57.22,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&HF5F5F5&\fnFree Pixel\\fs70\b1\blur0.7\pos(511.71,496.38)}A Guy Who Reincarnated as a \NFantasy Knockout and a Choice
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.85,0:01:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, little bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.17,0:02:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be eating meat today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.57,0:02:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.49,0:02:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that your first time then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.23,0:02:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eating your first kill is\Nsomething really special, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like to try it raw?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.67,0:02:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone says they can't eat\Nmeat and you recommend it raw.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.59,0:02:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.47,0:02:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.07,0:02:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seems so shady.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.55,0:02:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.85,0:02:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you haven't made\Nthe best impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.53,0:02:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you'll put up with me\Nuntil we reach the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.57,0:02:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, my cart is broken\Nand my croco-dog ran away,
