Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.91,0:02:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so now my only means of\Ntransportation is walking all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.27,0:02:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.31,0:02:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you broke it, we\Ncan't exactly argue. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.85,0:02:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since my charm doesn't work on\Nhim, I guess it's fine, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.13,0:02:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Tachibana.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Jinguuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.87,0:02:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm called Chen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.27,0:02:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of you have such unusual names.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.95,0:02:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you two come from anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.51,0:02:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't disclose our personal info considering\Nhow friendly you were with that elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.97,0:02:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to wonder if you\Nmight be from the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:03:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I totally forgot\Nabout the village head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.35,0:03:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think it's okay to leave her behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A woman who'd take our lives\Nat the first opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We couldn't bring her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.39,0:03:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This squid is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.61,0:03:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the god of your forest\Nwas pretty darn good too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.11,0:03:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Well. Whose?
