Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.97,0:03:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your physical stats may not improve
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.43,0:03:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.35,0:03:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I have a rough understanding\Nof how we level up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.01,0:03:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After beating the first monster, I was\Nthe only one to gain experience points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.87,0:03:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even though the premier helped kill
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.99,0:03:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the squid, your level\Nincreased too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.41,0:03:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now that you mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.93,0:03:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very likely that\NClose contact is the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.67,0:03:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.59,0:03:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Close contact?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.61,0:03:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, is that the reason\Nyou made me kill that rabbit earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.07,0:03:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.73,0:03:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would have objected even if I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.11,0:03:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I finished making dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.53,0:03:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.41,0:03:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.33,0:03:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bunny, you're too yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.81,0:04:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, this guy's always\Nkilling stuff so he can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.51,0:04:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.61,0:04:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinkoji's hands are really big,\Nor is it that mine are small?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.03,0:04:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.23,0:04:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, party time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.51,0:04:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, why are you following me? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.25,0:04:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could get abducted if I don't, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.45,0:04:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in the apartment, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.37,0:04:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that blithe disregard\Nbrought about the last incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.15,0:04:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided I won't\Nlet down my guard again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.45,0:04:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By which you mean you're\Ngoing to wait there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.99,0:04:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.93,0:04:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do this with you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.23,0:04:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is your love nest, then? Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.49,0:04:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a freeloader and nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.41,0:04:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.31,0:04:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we're alone now, there's\Nsomething I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know why you're following us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.55,0:04:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are your intentions?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.89,0:04:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you, really?
