Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead, he has assassination\Ntechniques, of all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.21,0:05:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't bode well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.41,0:05:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe while Tachibana is out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you my\Nintentions earlier, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.19,0:05:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would appreciate it if you\Nwould allow me to accompany you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.81,0:05:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It isn't bloodlust, but what is it I feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.17,0:05:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is tachibana his target this\Nmust look like a good opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.67,0:05:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to a slave trader but he\Nhasn't mentioned it i knew he
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.79,0:05:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was no ordinary man please wait\Nlisten if i had meant to harm
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.77,0:05:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you at all i would have just\Nput something into the food i
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.31,0:05:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,made you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.23,0:05:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,earlier and as it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.43,0:05:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happens that's just what i did
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.89,0:05:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but only a little something\Nblast it so tell me how are you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.13,0:06:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feeling right now your body must\Nhave started to heat up right
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.35,0:06:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,poison or some kind of drug taking\Nour ability to move and then
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.83,0:06:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i gave tachibana a lecture\Nnow look what i've done
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.45,0:06:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my head's foggy i can't think straight
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.91,0:06:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but i can still move which means
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.33,0:06:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now i demand that you tell\Nme your true objectives?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.19,0:06:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.03,0:06:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your body is just as I'd imagined!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.23,0:06:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.93,0:06:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we begin this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.09,0:06:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.05,0:06:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, you're strong, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.29,0:06:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, whatcha doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.51,0:06:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't come closer, Tachibana!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.29,0:06:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He drugged us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.97,0:06:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm having trouble moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's likely he's after you. Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.33,0:07:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't just leave you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.43,0:07:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After you've escaped,\NI'll figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.03,0:07:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.95,0:07:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we get separated, we may\Nnever see each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.99,0:07:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worry about that after you\Nget to safety, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperation. Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Jinguuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.05,0:07:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I didn't look like this, we\Ncould have stayed together longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.01,0:07:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been this way since we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.73,0:07:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All because I'm so freaking cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that only causes trouble for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.09,0:07:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.91,0:07:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.91,0:07:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't actually think you're that cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.51,0:07:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, Tachibana, I'm not really\Nattracted to you in the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't suit my tastes at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.45,0:07:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I'm not targeting you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I've never once thought of\Nselling you as a slave, so please,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.01,0:07:45.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't even worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.73,0:07:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, have you seen me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.75,0:07:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.91,0:07:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a slave trader, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.47,0:07:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have your eyes rotted out or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.23,0:07:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's your disposition\Nthat's rotten, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.11,0:07:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get lured in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.35,0:07:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to hurry up and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.17,0:08:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, my cuteness happens to be\Nmy entire identity right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.03,0:08:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's gone, what else is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.03,0:08:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just said your cuteness only\Ncaused trouble, and now this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since Jinguuji can't fight, I'm the\Nonly one who can do anything about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.29,0:08:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't seem affected by\Nme for some reason, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.29,0:08:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's time for me\Nto pull out the big gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.83,0:08:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is your deal?
