Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.29,0:08:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna show you how\Ngood softness can be! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.09,0:08:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I see something like that when\NI'm already unwell, I'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting charmed on top of all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.05,0:08:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cuteness! I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.61,0:08:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This calls for muscle! A man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.61,0:08:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just look at a man\Nand call him right down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.33,0:08:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like your partner got distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.67,0:08:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't maintain interest, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.79,0:08:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for you, Tachibana.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.09,0:09:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as you can see, Jinguji has\Nchosen my body over yours. Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.61,0:09:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.61,0:09:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't it mean that in this moment\NI'm more attractive than you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.59,0:09:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.51,0:09:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally I'd be able to say it wasn't\Ntrue, but we're talking about Jinguji here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.25,0:09:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's totally possible\Nyou'd choose a male body!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.99,0:09:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that really what you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.93,0:09:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, make a choice, Jinguji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.77,0:09:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In your opinion, which\None of us do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.93,0:09:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.03,0:09:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop, my brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.67,0:09:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.59,0:09:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.31,0:09:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which of us is cuter is a simple question!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.87,0:09:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really expect me to answer that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what I say, I'm\Nchoosing a man! A man! A man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.47,0:09:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Tachibana, are you a man?
