Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.51,0:09:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.01,0:09:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still a pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.55,0:09:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're super rude, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.07,0:09:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you so squishy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.31,0:10:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That body is a crime, you know, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.11,0:10:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree that it's a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But because of its cuteness, not\Nits softness, you total weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.65,0:10:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your vanity's on the extreme side, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.19,0:10:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are the facts, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.49,0:10:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of you, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.81,0:10:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.19,0:10:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinguuji!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.51,0:10:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears the man has\Nfinally reached his limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.27,0:10:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me. Go. Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.49,0:10:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.41,0:10:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy keeps provoking me\Nand I keep taking the bait
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.61,0:10:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if he's not interested\Nin me then What does he want
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.95,0:10:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait. If he's not into me,\Nidiot! You're the one who needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To run, Jinguuji! What?\NShen isn't the one he wants!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.27,0:10:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's after...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.15,0:10:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.53,0:10:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, shall we begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.09,0:10:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Shen, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.75,0:10:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know you have to get consent\Nbefore you do things like that?
