Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.03,0:11:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana, what's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.37,0:11:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this torture?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.17,0:11:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.35,0:11:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's giving you a massage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.19,0:11:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.11,0:11:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is my family has knowledge of\Nsecret pressure points found on the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.27,0:11:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have secret pressure points?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.27,0:11:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you could say that I just couldn't\Nturn away from this level of fatigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.21,0:11:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I hadn't been this forceful,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinguji probably wouldn't have\Nlet me treat him, would he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.45,0:11:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, these muscles are amazing.
