Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.95,0:11:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.69,0:11:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, you're not\Na young man anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.37,0:11:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The effects of the drug are\Nstronger the more fatigued you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.35,0:11:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too, so you really had no chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.25,0:11:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was enough to knock you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.15,0:11:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be more self-aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.73,0:11:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so I've got to ask, did\Nyou give me that drug too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.27,0:12:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I actually gave\Nyou a laxative instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.43,0:12:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.19,0:12:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.03,0:12:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm forbidden to come\Nwithin a ten meter radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.09,0:12:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder, how was it that my\Ntrue identity was exposed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.25,0:12:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, no, it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.25,0:12:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps he has a sixth sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.63,0:12:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, well, this is certainly\Nout of the ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.43,0:12:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.55,0:12:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is...
