Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.77,0:12:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.89,0:12:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kind of a spoiler?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.89,0:12:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling better now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.09,0:12:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossibly good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.27,0:12:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that means Shen's\Ngot some magic hands, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.25,0:12:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.17,0:12:54.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on if we feel even a little bit\Ntired let's make sure to take a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.95,0:12:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tired, huh? I've never even
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.95,0:13:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seen this guy catch a cold I
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.13,0:13:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guess it shows how much of\Na burden I'm putting on him
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.97,0:13:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the very least I need to be\Nable to protect myself I can see it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.53,0:13:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's the royal capital\Nthey've got security
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.33,0:13:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's because there was a war not long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.97,0:13:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You scared me. I told you.\NTen meters. I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.91,0:13:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you might have some\Ntrouble what do you mean
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.17,0:13:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't get inside I don't know of course
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.05,0:13:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be able to guide\Nyou in without a problem
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.69,0:13:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in return I'd like to show\Nyou around the capital and such
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.83,0:13:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the royal capital\NIshurnah look at that the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,houses are made of stone so\NI can guide You anywhere you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.33,0:13:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like are there any temples\Nwell let's see the temple of
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the goddess of love and\NBeauty is right over there why
