Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.31,0:14:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beauty she's so pretty how can\Nthis be she's so respectable
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.65,0:14:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clean, tidy, polite. Not a\Nsingle issue with her deportment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.55,0:14:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this is a temple for\Nthe worship of that crappy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.85,0:14:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goddess. I had an image in my\Nhead of some kind of sleazy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pool party but now you have a\Ntruly powerful imagination oh
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.23,0:14:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh my are You might you\Npossibly be hoping to join our
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.45,0:14:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,faith she smells so good I can\Ntell with just one look You
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.75,0:14:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are perfectly suited to being\Na servant of our beloved
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.45,0:14:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,goddess please you must follow\Nme this way Is this okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.87,0:14:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, but we need to get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.47,0:14:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's someone else accompanying me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.55,0:14:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, don't trouble yourself over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.41,0:14:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.11,0:14:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.03,0:14:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, our goddess rules\Nover love and beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.01,0:15:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of that, the temple\Nmust always be kept beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.37,0:15:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the same goes for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.27,0:15:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're under obligation as her believers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.97,0:15:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, you must change\Ninto the garb of our order.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.71,0:15:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garb, nice, I like the sound of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.61,0:15:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss, is there some mistake? Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.59,0:15:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't clothing so much as underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our order's garb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.79,0:15:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like bits of string.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.53,0:15:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our order's garb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.33,0:15:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.43,0:15:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must understand,\Nthat's our official dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.21,0:15:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only those wearing it are permitted\Nto enter our place of worship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.13,0:15:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.29,0:15:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please do call for me once you've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.09,0:15:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I I don't know I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.93,0:15:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I can go through with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.83,0:15:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana you remember our\Nobjective in coming here together?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.93,0:15:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Info that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.01,0:15:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No you can't be just steal your nerves I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.15,0:16:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,already have you're\Nkidding you know all kinds
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.09,0:16:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of stuff is Gonna pop\Nout of this thing right
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.89,0:16:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.87,0:16:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you done
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.79,0:16:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming out okay?
