Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.69,0:16:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,being serious you tricked me\Nnow I see what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.11,0:16:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.03,0:16:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope it was worth\Nhumiliating your only friend
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.49,0:16:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To see me in this\Nglorified piece of floss!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.75,0:16:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me out to be the bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.75,0:16:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The priestess was wearing\Nclothes, wasn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.01,0:16:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.61,0:16:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you finished changing them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.01,0:16:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it suits you very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.33,0:16:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the gentleman...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.43,0:16:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still a little reluctant\Nto show so much skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.73,0:16:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you wearing it under your clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.79,0:16:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, as you're observing\Ntoday, that should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.87,0:17:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.79,0:17:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.70,0:17:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'd appreciate having\Nsomething to drape over myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.19,0:17:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, take my robe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.43,0:17:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think it'll do.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.84,0:17:10.01,Signs,priestess,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(270,550)\fnDK Hobgoblin\b0\3c&HB951EA&\c&HB951EA&\bord1\fs125\frz33.5\t(0,450,\frz36.5)\t(450,900,\frz33.5)\t(900,1350,\frz36.5)\t(1350,1800,\frz33.5)\move(369.2,170.4,230.8,-4.8,20,1146)\1a&HFF&\t(270,270,\1a&H00&)\t(620,620,\1a&HFF&)}Eek
Dialogue: 2,0:17:08.84,0:17:10.01,Signs,priestess,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(270,550)\fnDK Hobgoblin\b0\c&H9C31FF&\bord0\fs125\frz33.5\t(0,450,\frz36.5)\t(450,900,\frz33.5)\t(900,1350,\frz36.5)\t(1350,1800,\frz33.5)\move(369.2,170.4,230.8,-4.8,20,1146)\4a&HFF&}Eek
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.39,0:17:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Showing that much skin to someone you've\Njust met is wrong though, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.05,0:17:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.23,0:17:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was that surprised when\NI first saw it as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.61,0:17:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm convinced one day that\Nfeeling will turn to joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.57,0:17:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is this okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.95,0:17:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.87,0:17:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a sacred space, so\Nplease, no carelessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.75,0:17:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our place of worship!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.91,0:17:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.69,0:17:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it the most splendidly\Nholy site you ever saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.09,0:17:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always say it's as though the\Ndeities have come to play in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.39,0:18:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana, tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.87,0:18:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind if I destroy this building?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.13,0:18:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.05,0:18:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's actually just like\Nyou imagined, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.45,0:18:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pool of revelers enjoying themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.35,0:18:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like it's saying that\Nmy thoughts are on the same
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.53,0:18:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,level as that goddess which\Ninfuriates me to no end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.93,0:18:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make it like it never existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.65,0:18:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's burned into my brain forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.41,0:18:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, let's bring you\Ninto our faith. The faith?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we only meant to observe today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.81,0:18:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.05,0:18:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please just leave everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.33,0:18:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're quite exceptional.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.23,0:18:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this world, you could\Nreach the highest heights.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.03,0:18:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss, I don't. I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.35,0:18:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please take off your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.33,0:18:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you said earlier I don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.07,0:18:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you try it once, it\Nwill be addictive. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.39,0:18:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.31,0:18:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.27,0:18:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let it go! Let it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.25,0:18:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like something\Nimportant's been stolen from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.11,0:19:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first thing that you must do\Nis make the most of what you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.55,0:19:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must show even more\Nof your lovely skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.25,0:19:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.37,0:19:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is that on your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.03,0:19:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, how could this be? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.05,0:19:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.55,0:19:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mark of our gracious\Ngoddess is there on your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.27,0:19:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.67,0:19:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What wickedness is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.37,0:19:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That isn't something\Nyou should do as a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.91,0:19:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, exactly what happens to a person\Nif they have this on their body?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.77,0:19:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After a proper judgment is done,\Nthere'll be a whipping at best!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.29,0:19:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And worse, she'll be\Nsent to a prison island!
