Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.89,0:19:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With such a criminal here,\Nthe very heir will be tainted!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.11,0:19:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and throw her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.95,0:19:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hands off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.41,0:19:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, believers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.05,0:19:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't want this stupid\Nseal any more than you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.07,0:19:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, we had no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.95,0:20:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid seal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.75,0:20:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, the crappy goddess's seal!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.91,0:20:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course we'd refuse something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.13,0:20:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crappy goddess?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.85,0:20:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment I was handed these swim briefs,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.07,0:20:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have knocked\Nthis temple to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.25,0:20:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You weren't even wearing them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.01,0:20:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.31,0:20:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, take up your weapons. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.15,0:20:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They shall experience deep regrets\Nalong with our goddess' love in spades!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.05,0:20:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now their hate's gone\Nfrom me to Jinguuji?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.43,0:20:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, the more people you take\Noff, the shorter your life's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.93,0:20:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more tiring trying\Nto be considerate of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.33,0:20:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, this is the kind of\Ndevelopment I actually like. Is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.83,0:20:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.85,0:20:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impressive magic, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.03,0:20:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That magic binding is meant especially\Nfor the conversion of heathens,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.61,0:20:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it won't come off\Nuntil you declare your
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.09,0:20:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,love for our goddess with an honest heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.09,0:20:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.01,0:20:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like that thing was\Nmade with Jinguji in mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.17,0:20:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't this world protect\Nfreedom of religion?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.59,0:21:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I thought, the religions of\Nthis medieval world are worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.39,0:21:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until you learn to show some\Nrespect for our holy goddess,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.31,0:21:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we will continue with your correction!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.19,0:21:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're out for our blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.19,0:21:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, no time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.15,0:21:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you're out for theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.85,0:21:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow! My chains! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.39,0:21:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They simply weren't strong\Nenough to be chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.83,0:21:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be done!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.45,0:21:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't allow this to continue any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.15,0:21:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, goddess in your\Nexultancy, master of love!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.35,0:21:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rhesus, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.91,0:21:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire at me if you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.69,0:21:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least you're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.87,0:21:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, we did not come here\Nto spill blood unnecessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.57,0:21:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we want is to inspect the prophecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.29,0:21:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The prophecy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.67,0:21:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would a heathen want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.97,0:21:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can give you the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.39,0:21:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These honored people are heroes who\Nhave been summoned here by the goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.05,0:21:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.93,0:21:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear me well, believers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.05,0:22:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interfering with them\Nis strictly forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.77,0:22:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen and heed this royal command.
